{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50107","headline":"游仙窟诗 咏双树 · 张文成","name":"游仙窟诗 咏双树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新华发两树，分香遍一林。\n迎风转细影，向日动轻阴。\n戏蜂时隐见，飞蝶远追寻。\n承闻欲采摘，若个动君心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张文成","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50107.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50107","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}